message: "If you use this code or these processed result tables, please cite the study (citation metadata finalised at release)."
title: "HITMAN factorial-specificity / comparative-electrotherapy study: analysis code, processed result tables and figure-generation scripts"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: "Analysis code, frozen processed (non-identifiable) result tables and figure-generation scripts for the HITMAN factorial-specificity / comparative-electrotherapy study. Figures are renders of the frozen result tables; no re-analysis is required to reproduce them."
keywords:
  - glioblastoma
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - factorial design
  - tumour-treating fields
  - reproducibility
